<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on the Milan MIB 30 index.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on the Milan MIB 30 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 20 million American-style call and put warrants, in four equal tranches, on the Milan MIB 30 index, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> ONE WARRANT REFERS TO ONE UNDERLYING.</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	31.MAR.98		 PAYDATE	29.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG (APPLIED)  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  18470 ITL</p>
<p>* * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE     STRIKE	ISSUE	 PREMIUM B/E	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL     18000 ITL   2385 ITL    10.36 PCT	  7.74 X</p>
<p> CALL     19000 ITL   1880 ITL    13.04 PCT	  9.82 X</p>
<p> PUT	18000 ITL   1160 ITL    9.68 PCT	   15.9 X</p>
<p> PUT	19000 ITL   1650 ITL    6.45 PCT	   11.2 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
